        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Now that I think about it, I think I will end up with a fork.\nI plan to have the char in the description colored if it is the keys.\nWhich will look like this:\n```\nS│  Join [S]plit                 │\nJ│  [J]oin Toggle                │\n```\nBut with proper colors inside the [].\n\nThis is for me the smallest amount of mental overhead + jumping from the description column to the key column is too harsh for my eyes.\nThanks a lot for mini.clue ❤️ ",
